msgctxt "96"
msgid ""
"Sorry I'm not actually wearin' the thing. Pendants aren't really my style, "
"but I always have it with me in my wallet! Never go anywhere without it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Io..."

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"C'mon, quit playin' dumb. Tokyo didn't change you that much, did it? Deep "
"down, we're still just two stupid kids from Okinawa... right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"Well, actually... The truth is, I'm Natsumi's sister. My real name is Akiho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "But I don't remember Natsumi having a sister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Shouldn't I have at least heard of you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Not necessarily. Natsumi and I are a few years apart... and I went to school"
" on the mainland, so we were kind of distant at the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Well, sure... But she never even mentioned you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Really? Natsumi told me all about you, Shimabukuro-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "What about that pendant? Why do you have it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Oh, Natsumi gave it to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Huh? She just... gave it away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"People change, Rikiya. You said it's been years since you've seen her, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"Maybe... but I hung onto mine all this time, so I always assumed Natsumi "
"would do the same. Guess I was wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "...Here, I'll walk you two out. Let me get my stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "That was great, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"But I gotta say, I kinda dig the girls down in Okinawa more. They're "
"aggressive. Domineering. That's the shit that really gets my gears turnin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "What are you talking about? You were practically drooling in there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"Hehe, what can I say? I might have my preferences, but I still lose my mind "
"when there's a hot girl in front of me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Good night! See you next week!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Psst, Aniki, that's the dancer! I can smell her perfume from here... God, I "
"love Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Hey, sorry if this is kinda weird or whatever, but I loved the show! You "
"were great out there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Not surprising, knowin' the town we're in. I bet you could even be on TV if "
"you wanted!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"I really appreciate that.  Maybe you could come see me again if you liked it"
" that much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Oh, where are my manners? My name is Natsumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Natsumi, huh? Pretty name... Wait, don't I know you from somewhere?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"Natsumi, Natsumi, Natsumi... Oh yeah! Natsumi Uesato! I remember you now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"I'm Rikiya, Rikiya Shimabukuro. That ring a bell? We sat next to each other "
"in middle school, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Wait, you know her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"She's an old friend, yeah! She disappeared after we graduated middle school,"
" though. It's been, what, nine years now? Man, time flies!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"And hey, I know girls're supposed to change as they grow up, but holy shit. "
"You're freakin' gorgeous now! Who would've thought we'd end up bumpin' into "
"each other like this all the way up here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"...I'm sorry, but I think you have the wrong person. Natsumi is just my "
"stage name."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"Oh... Ouch. Sorry, guess I was getting a tiny bit carried away there. But I "
"could've sworn I was right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid ""
"It's totally fine. Anyway, um... I should be getting ready for my next "
"dance. Thanks again for stopping by my show."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "So this is how they do it up here... Wild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Here, this one's on me. Something to remember Tokyo by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Thanks, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Whoa!"
msgstr "Caspita!"

msgctxt "684"
msgid "Ooh, baby!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Oh, yeah!"
msgstr "Oh, sì!"

msgctxt "732"
msgid "Phew, she's smokin'!"
msgstr ""

